# The joint certificate: data part 1

Blocks of the tables of the joint certificate `𝖸`. At each level `q`, the pairs `(r, k)` with
`𝖸_q(r, k) ≠ 0` are listed in increasing order of the key `r̃ 2^13 + k`; the block `b` holds the
entries `256 b` to `256 b + 255` of that list, the keys as `32`-bit lanes and the values as
`64`-bit lanes.

## Main definitions

* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_0`: level `1`, keys `0` to `255`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYValBlock1_0`: level `1`, values `0` to `255`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_1`: level `1`, keys `256` to `511`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYValBlock1_1`: level `1`, values `256` to `511`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_2`: level `1`, keys `512` to `767`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYValBlock1_2`: level `1`, values `512` to `767`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_3`: level `1`, keys `768` to `1023`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYValBlock1_3`: level `1`, values `768` to `1023`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_4`: level `1`, keys `1024` to `1279`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYValBlock1_4`: level `1`, values `1024` to `1279`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_5`: level `1`, keys `1280` to `1535`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYValBlock1_5`: level `1`, values `1280` to `1535`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_6`: level `1`, keys `1536` to `1791`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYValBlock1_6`: level `1`, values `1536` to `1791`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_7`: level `1`, keys `1792` to `2047`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYValBlock1_7`: level `1`, values `1792` to `2047`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_8`: level `1`, keys `2048` to `2303`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYValBlock1_8`: level `1`, values `2048` to `2303`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_9`: level `1`, keys `2304` to `2559`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYValBlock1_9`: level `1`, values `2304` to `2559`.
* `CollatzPosDens.jointCertYKeyBlock1_10`: level `1`, keys `2560` to `2815`.
